cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ThermoTwin-F in research or teaching, please cite the archived software version."
title: "ThermoTwin-F: An Educational Gas-Turbine and Combined-Cycle Simulation Framework"
type: software
version: 2.0.0-beta.1
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23679426"
date-released: 2026-10-27
authors:
  - family-names: Sivaprasadan
    given-names: Abhijith
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0299-5745"
abstract: >-
  Open-source Fortran software for educational gas-turbine and combined-cycle
  performance studies, degradation and inverse diagnostics, exergy accounting,
  uncertainty and sensitivity analyses, and experimental plant/grid scenarios.
  Internal numerical and regression checks are provided; the software is not
  validated against a particular commercial plant or certified for operations.
keywords:
  - gas turbine
  - combined cycle
  - thermodynamics
  - exergy analysis
  - uncertainty quantification
  - modern Fortran
  - research software
repository-code: "https://github.com/abhijith-sivaprasadan/thermotwin"
url: "https://github.com/abhijith-sivaprasadan/thermotwin"
license: MIT
